---
description: Prepare one packageOperations evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: PuzzlePlaytest[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Produce the full operating pack: setup, reset, hints, accessibility variants, prop checks, and staff recovery procedures. Verify reset completeness and session isolation, then obtain safety and creative review separately from the mathematical solvability check. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
